# Joveo Component Rules (shadcn/ui Implementation)

## Component Implementation Guidelines

This file contains base components and guidelines. For specific component implementations, refer to:

1. Data Grid Components: See `data-grid.mdc`
2. Navigation Components: See `navigation.mdc`
3. Dialog Components: See `dialog.mdc`
4. Empty State Components: See `empty-state.mdc`
5. Footer Components: See `footer.mdc`
6. Form Components: See `form.mdc`
7. Dropdown Components: See `dropdown.mdc`

### Typography Components

#### Text Components
```typescript
import { Typography } from "@/components/ui/typography"

// Headings
<Typography variant="h1" className="text-content-darker">
  Large Display Text
</Typography>

// Body Text
<Typography variant="p" className="text-sm font-medium text-content-DEFAULT">
  Body Text
</Typography>

// Subtle Text
<Typography variant="muted" className="text-xs text-content-light">
  Muted Text
</Typography>
```

### Button Components

#### Primary Button
```typescript
import { Button } from "@/components/ui/button"

<Button variant="default" className="bg-primary hover:bg-primary-dark">
  Primary Action
</Button>

// Secondary Button
<Button variant="secondary" className="bg-secondary hover:bg-secondary-dark">
  Secondary Action
</Button>

// Outline Button
<Button variant="outline" className="border-primary text-primary hover:bg-primary-lighter">
  Outline Action
</Button>
```

### Card Components

#### Analytics Card
```typescript
