  </CardHeader>
  <CardContent>
    <div className="space-y-2">
      <div className="flex justify-between items-center">
        <span className="text-sm text-content-DEFAULT">Metric</span>
        <span className="text-sm font-medium text-content-darker">Value</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </CardContent>
</Card>
```

## Component Best Practices

### General Guidelines
1. Use shadcn/ui components as base
2. Extend with Tailwind classes for Joveo-specific styling
3. Maintain consistent spacing using Tailwind spacing scale
4. Use semantic color classes from the theme
5. Implement responsive designs using Tailwind breakpoints

### Typography
1. Use Typography component for consistent text styling
2. Apply proper font weights using Tailwind classes
3. Maintain text color hierarchy using content-* classes
4. Use appropriate text sizes for different screen sizes

### Layout
1. Use Flexbox and Grid with Tailwind classes
2. Implement proper spacing using Tailwind space-* utilities
3. Use container queries for responsive layouts
4. Maintain consistent padding and margins

### Interactive Elements
1. Implement proper hover and focus states
2. Use appropriate cursor styles
3. Add loading states where needed
4. Include proper disabled states

### Accessibility
1. Include proper ARIA labels
2. Maintain sufficient color contrast
3. Implement keyboard navigation
4. Add screen reader support

